 --> a.azl:4:1
  |
4 | xs.extend([2])
  | ^
---- asserted 4:1 cannot change `xs`: declare it with `var` to make it changeable
---- run check --json a.azl
---- exit 1
---- stdout
{"severity":"error","code":"E0401","message":"cannot change `xs`: declare it with `var` to make it changeable","file":"a.azl","line":4,"column":1,"end_line":4,"end_column":3,"source":"xs.extend([2])","rule":"A variable declared with `let` never changes; only one declared with `var` can be assigned, grown or passed as `mut`.","help":"Declare the variable with `var` instead of `let`.","fix":{"file":"a.azl","line":3,"column":1,"end_line":3,"end_column":4,"replacement":"var"}}
